    "到点推送一条本地提醒，提醒你写日记。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sends a local reminder at this time to write."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "应用锁（Face ID / 密码）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App Lock (Face ID / Passcode)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后，每次打开随心记需通过 Face ID、Touch ID 或设备密码。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, opening SuixinJi requires Face ID, Touch ID, or your passcode."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此设备未设置密码或生物识别，无法开启应用锁。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This device has no passcode or biometrics, so App Lock is unavailable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 同步": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud Sync"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "登录 iCloud 后，日记文字、图片与录音都会在你的设备间自动同步。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When signed in to iCloud, your entries' text, photos, and recordings sync across your devices automatically."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导出备份": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Export Backup"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入备份": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import Backup"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导出为一个 .json 文件（含图片与录音），换机或重装后可导入恢复。导入按 id 合并，不会覆盖已有日记。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Exports a single .json file (with photos and recordings) you can import to restore after switching or reinstalling. Import merges by id and never overwrites existing entries."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重命名、合并或删除标签，改动会应用到所有日记。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rename, merge, or delete tags — changes apply to every entry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "左滑重命名或删除。重命名为已有标签会合并两者。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Swipe left to rename or delete. Renaming to an existing tag merges the two."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重命名标签": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
