    "今天，有什么让你嘴角上扬的小事？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What small thing made you smile today?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此刻你在想什么？把它写下来。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What are you thinking right now? Write it down."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今天遇到的一个人，让你有什么感受？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Someone you met today — how did they make you feel?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "如果用一个词形容今天，会是什么？为什么？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One word for today — what is it, and why?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "最近有什么一直放不下的事？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What's been on your mind lately?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今天你对自己说的一句话是？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What did you tell yourself today?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有什么想感谢的人或事吗？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anyone or anything you're grateful for?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今天吃到、看到、听到的，哪一样最难忘？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What you ate, saw, or heard today — what stuck with you?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "如果可以对昨天的自己说一句话，你会说什么？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you could tell yesterday's self one thing, what would it be?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此刻窗外是什么样子？你的心情呢？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What's outside your window right now? And your mood?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "最近让你悄悄期待的一件事是什么？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What are you quietly looking forward to?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今天有没有一个瞬间，你希望它慢一点？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was there a moment today you wished would slow down?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "写下一件今天做成的小事，哪怕很小。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Write one thing you got done today, however small."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此刻身体累吗？心累吗？发生了什么？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tired in body or in spirit right now? What happened?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "如果今天是一部电影，它的名字叫？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If today were a movie, what would it be called?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
