    "同步心情到「健康」": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sync mood to Health"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后，保存带心情的日记时，会在「健康」App 记录一条对应的情绪（State of Mind）。仅写入，随心记不会读取你的健康数据。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, saving an entry with a mood also logs a matching State of Mind in the Health app. Write-only — SuixinJi never reads your health data."
          }
        }
      }
    },
